    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGuirk Beggan Property is delighted to present 33 Brookfield Green to the market. This superb three-bedroom home has been beautifully upgraded by the current owners and benefits from stunning features such as a modern kitchen/breakfast room, bright & spacious living room, generous master bedroom with ensuite, attic conversion and a sunny west facing rear garden to name a few. The entire property has been completely renovated & transformed with great flair and style, offering a beautiful turnkey home. No expense has been spared in creating this wonderful home with plenty of functional spaces for the discerning purchaser. \n\nThe accommodation comprises of entrance hall, guest wc, kitchen/breakfast room, living room, three bedrooms, master ensuite, main bathroom & attic conversion.\n\nThe location is second to none with a host of excellent local amenities on your doorstep. There is a selection of South Dublin`s finest junior and senior schools and a range of shopping facilities all close by. There are a number of bus routes close by providing easy access to the city centre and the M50 network is minutes away. Leisure facilities are also well catered for with Carlisle Health and Fitness centre only a short stroll away. Terenure village and Supervalu Sundrive are both within walking distance of the property.\n\nThis stunning property ticks all the right boxes in terms of contemporary design, space, light and exceptional location!\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Renovated in 2019/2020 </li><li> New gas boiler - 2022 </li><li> New windows - 2020 </li><li> Attic conversion - divided into two parts - home office & utility area - 2020 </li><li> Off street parking on cobble lock drive </li><li> Not overlooked front or back </li><li> Close to many local amenities </li><li> Excellent decorative condition throughout</li></ul>"
      },
